            "value" : "%@ hat Benutzername oder Passwort nicht angenommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn't accept this iPhone's key. Add the key to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys there (Settings > This iPhone)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ hat den Schlüssel dieses iPhones nicht angenommen. Trag ihn dort in ~/.ssh/authorized_keys ein (Einstellungen > Dieses iPhone)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is new. Its key: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ ist neu. Sein Schlüssel: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is new. Its key: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ now presents %@. That happens when the computer was set up again, but it can also mean that someone is in between. Only continue if you know why it changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ zeigt jetzt %2$@. Das passiert, wenn der Rechner neu eingerichtet wurde, kann aber auch heißen, dass jemand dazwischen sitzt. Mach nur weiter, wenn du weißt, warum er sich geändert hat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ now presents %2$@. That happens when the computer was set up again, but it can also mean that someone is in between. Only continue if you know why it changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ to open aOS" : {
